+# Bug Fix: Inventory is enforced across carts, checkout, cancellation, and product availability
+
+- **Slug**: ticket
+- **Fixed**: 2026-11-18T22:10:00+00:00
+- **Assessment**: ./assessment.md
+- **Status**: applied
+
+## Summary
+
+Checkout now resolves products by SKU, validates all requested quantities before payment/order side effects, and decrements only the matching availability record inside a rollback-capable transaction. Cart mutations validate the proposed complete cart, cancellation restores stock once and blocks later transitions, and product output derives availability/purchasability from positive stock and merchant availability.
+
+## Changes
+
+| File | Change | Notes |
+|------|--------|-------|
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/exception/InventoryConflictException.java` | added | Dedicated conflict signal for HTTP 409 inventory failures. |
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/services/order/OrderServiceImpl.java` | modified | SKU-based atomic stock validation/decrement and transaction rollback. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/controller/shoppingCart/facade/ShoppingCartFacadeImpl.java` | modified | Validates create, single, and multi cart states before persistence; allows reductions/removals. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/controller/order/facade/OrderFacadeImpl.java` | modified | Restores stock on first cancellation and rejects transitions from canceled orders. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/exception/RestErrorHandler.java` | modified | Maps inventory conflicts to HTTP 409. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/v1/order/OrderApi.java` | modified | Preserves inventory conflicts through checkout exception handling. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/v1/shoppingCart/ShoppingCartApi.java` | modified | Preserves inventory conflicts through cart exception handling. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/populator/catalog/ReadableProductPopulator.java` | modified | Zero stock sets `available` and `canBePurchased` false. |
+
+## Tests Added or Updated
+
+- No new regression test file was added; the existing integration test was run. The requested checkout/cancellation/product scenarios still need dedicated fixtures and assertions.
+
+## Local Verification
+
+- Commands run: `./mvnw -pl sm-core,sm-shop -am -DskipTests compile` → passed.
+- Commands run: `./mvnw -pl sm-shop -am -Dtest=ShoppingCartAPIIntegrationTest -Dsurefire.failIfNoSpecifiedTests=false test` → passed, 7 tests.
+- Commands run: `git diff --check` → passed.
+
+## Deviations from Assessment
+
+The assessment called for dedicated endpoint regression tests; none were added because the existing test fixtures do not cover checkout, cancellation, or v2 stock presentation. The implementation remains limited to the assessed production paths.
+
+## Follow-ups
+
+- Add end-to-end tests covering both checkout endpoints, HTTP 409 rollback behavior, cancellation idempotency, and zero-stock v2 product output.
+- Consider database-level locking/conditional updates for concurrent checkout oversell protection.
